{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o013a","title":"朱然围樊城司马懿率众拒退","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o013a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"朱然围樊城司马懿率众拒退","evidence":["shaodi-e-o013a-q"]},{"id":"liusima-a-938eef97d973308dee07","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"正始二年朱然围樊城，守将乙修等求救甚急","evidence":["liusima-q-70d7dc6fd929ae6d41a4"]},{"id":"liusima-a-3829ce23c17ff3522522","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"夏侯儒进屯邓塞，以兵少不敢进，作鼓吹设导从翱翔而还示救","evidence":["liusima-q-2c64e66934fef0012fa0"]},{"id":"liusima-a-5d98975b299e434ee081","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"月余太傅到乃俱进，朱然等走","evidence":["liusima-q-3ef9ed0e108f57517e16"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-3a2f8f4f4a9c749fd553","label":"正文","text":"朱然攻樊，据与朱异破城外围；还，拜偏将军","evidence":["zhulv-q-b67f8c2f45d747b56b24"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-84da31a3d73cbb65bf25","label":"正文","text":"赤乌四年，异随朱然攻魏樊城；建计破其外围，还拜偏将军","evidence":["zhulv-q-c03cc9d0b63dbe4212b5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"围攻","evidence":["shaodi-e-o013a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"拒敌","evidence":["shaodi-e-o013a-q"]},{"person":"liusima-p0001","role":"城中守将，等求救甚急；等遥见之","evidence":["liusima-q-70d7dc6fd929ae6d41a4","liusima-q-2c64e66934fef0012fa0"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0025","role":"进屯邓塞，以兵少不敢进，但作鼓吹设导从，去然六七里翱翔而还，使修等遥见之，数数如是；及太傅到乃俱进","evidence":["liusima-q-2c64e66934fef0012fa0","liusima-q-3ef9ed0e108f57517e16"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0127","role":"破外围者","evidence":["zhulv-q-b67f8c2f45d747b56b24"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0126","role":"破外围者；从攻而建计者","evidence":["zhulv-q-b67f8c2f45d747b56b24","zhulv-q-c03cc9d0b63dbe4212b5"]}],"place":{"text":"樊城","evidence":["shaodi-q-o013"]},"time":{"year":241,"label":"夏五月至六月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y241","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o012","basis":"夏五月至六月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o013a-q","shaodi-q-o012","shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o013a-q","source_order":[4,60,"O013a"],"related_events":[{"event":"wuzhu-e-o133b","type":"related","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o133b-q","shaodi-e-o013a-q"]}],"order":1001},{"id":"liusima-e2-wei015-071","title":"张既讨伊健妓妾、治元多，进显美设伏破胡","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-fb0816ac3125f8a3026f","label":"正文","text":"卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反，河西大扰","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ce06ab46d7b20a6bf426","label":"正文","text":"帝忧河西之乱，召邹岐，以张既代之","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f"]},{"id":"liusima-a-eb58027d88c02e795e84","label":"正文","text":"帝诏张既谋略过人今则其时，以便宜从事勿复先请","evidence":["liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb"]},{"id":"liusima-a-73c4204e3f857411b567","label":"正文","text":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等继张既之后","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1"]},{"id":"liusima-a-2cc52acdac5812545073","label":"正文","text":"张既至金城力排众议渡河西进","evidence":["liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba"]},{"id":"liusima-a-3bfe498f1c98aeaacf1c","label":"正文","text":"贼骑逆拒鹯阴口，张既扬声鹯阴潜出揟次至武威，胡引还显美","evidence":["liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ff7d56750ebe088a52a2","label":"正文","text":"张既据武威劳赐将士，力主进军，军显美","evidence":["liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"id":"liusima-a-47c4f6182e5aed76f3af","label":"正文","text":"胡骑数千因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","evidence":["liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-56c6808baa8864094778","label":"正文","text":"张既夜设伏兵，使成公英挑战佯退，大破胡，斩首获生以万数","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e"]},{"id":"liusima-a-68feef8b5164ebebd4b8","label":"正文","text":"帝诏褒张既破胡之功，徙封西乡侯增邑二百","evidence":["liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0002","role":"卢水胡，与治元多等反，河西大扰","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"忧之，称非既莫能安凉州，乃召邹岐，以既代之；诏既引贾复请击郾贼故事，称卿谋略过人今则其时，以便宜从事，勿复先请；遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等继既后；甚悦，诏褒既逾河历险、以劳击逸、以寡胜众，功过南仲勤逾吉甫，此勋永宁河右，徙封西乡侯","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"代邹岐统军，显美设伏破胡","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},{"person":"liusima-p0062","role":"被召还","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0025","role":"护军，受遣继既后；等犹未达","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0012","role":"将军，受遣继既后；继至武威","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"参军，督千余骑挑战佯退","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","related_events":[{"event":"wendi-e-p080a","type":"related","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","wendi-e-p080a-q"]}],"order":3304},{"id":"liusima-e-o112","title":"酒泉苏衡与羌豪邻戴及丁令胡万余骑攻边县","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-55f3673199eea8ca92a6","label":"正文","text":"酒泉苏衡与羌豪邻戴及丁令胡万余骑攻边县","evidence":["liusima-q-833b8129f3e6d994cdcc"]},{"id":"liusima-a-59edea62421282bb4d2b","label":"正文","text":"张既与夏侯儒击破苏衡等，衡及邻戴等皆降","evidence":["liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d"]},{"id":"liusima-a-1c0f8bdf66edcb8e8715","label":"正文","text":"西羌恐，率众二万余落降","evidence":["liusima-q-8c1a5f9770285ceb1efe"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0056","role":"酒泉，反，与邻戴及丁令胡万余骑攻边县；兵败降","evidence":["liusima-q-833b8129f3e6d994cdcc","liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d"]},{"person":"liusima-p0063","role":"羌豪，与苏衡反；降","evidence":["liusima-q-833b8129f3e6d994cdcc","liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"与夏侯儒击破苏衡等","evidence":["liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0025","role":"与既击破之","evidence":["liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-833b8129f3e6d994cdcc","liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d","liusima-q-8c1a5f9770285ceb1efe"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-833b8129f3e6d994cdcc","source_order":[15,181,0],"order":3323}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0025","name":"夏侯儒","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p009","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d","liusima-q-2c64e66934fef0012fa0","liusima-q-3ef9ed0e108f57517e16"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p009-xiahoucao-p0025","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p009"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既夜藏精卒三千人为伏，使参军成公英，督千余骑挑战，敕使佯退。胡果争奔之，因发伏，截其后；首尾进击，大破之，斩首获生以万数","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":143,"end":203},{"id":"liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"贼七千余骑。逆拒军于鹯阴口〖6〗。既扬声军由鹯阴〖7〗，乃潜由（且）〔揟〕次出至武威〖8〗。胡以为神，引还显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":127},{"id":"liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-09fc0acef808d7824108","layer":"original","quote":"帝甚悦，诏曰：“卿逾河历险，以劳击逸，以寡胜众；功过南仲〖10〗，勤逾吉甫〖11〗。此勋非但破胡，乃永宁河右：使吾长无西顾之念矣！”徙封西乡侯，增邑二百；并前四百户","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"liusima-q-2c64e66934fef0012fa0","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-5e4b7498f6698dae76f2","layer":"pei","quote":"儒进屯邓塞，以兵少不敢进；但作鼓吹，设导从，去然六七里，翱翔而还：使修等遥见之，数数如是","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-801dbe2e127de8f14fbf","start":73,"end":117},{"id":"liusima-q-3ef9ed0e108f57517e16","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-5e4b7498f6698dae76f2","layer":"pei","quote":"月余，及太傅到，乃俱进。然等走","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-801dbe2e127de8f14fbf","start":118,"end":133},{"id":"liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"帝忧之，曰：“非既莫能安凉州。”乃召邹岐，以既代之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":49},{"id":"liusima-q-70d7dc6fd929ae6d41a4","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-5e4b7498f6698dae76f2","layer":"pei","quote":"正始二年，朱然围樊城，城中守将乙修等，求救甚急","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-801dbe2e127de8f14fbf","start":49,"end":72},{"id":"liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“昔贾复请击郾贼〖3〗，光武笑曰：‘执金吾击郾，吾复何忧？’卿谋略过人，今则其时。以便宜从事，勿复先请","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":104},{"id":"liusima-q-833b8129f3e6d994cdcc","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-6536fb52279fd3590597","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉苏衡反，与羌豪邻戴及丁令胡万余骑，攻边县","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"liusima-q-8c1a5f9770285ceb1efe","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-6536fb52279fd3590597","layer":"original","quote":"西羌恐，率众二万余落降","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":77,"end":88},{"id":"liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"既至金城，欲渡河，诸将、守以为：“兵少道险，未可深入。”既曰：“道虽险，非井陉之隘；夷狄乌合，无左车之计〖5〗。今武威危急，赴之宜速！”遂渡河","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等，继其后","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":109,"end":125},{"id":"liusima-q-da081c39eb9199cf650d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-6536fb52279fd3590597","layer":"original","quote":"既与夏侯儒击破之，衡及邻戴等皆降","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":42},{"id":"liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"胡骑数千，因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":124,"end":142},{"id":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"凉州卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反〖2〗，河西大扰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既已据武威，曜乃至，儒等犹未达。既劳赐将士，欲进军击胡。诸将皆曰：“士卒疲倦，虏众气锐，难与争锋。”既曰：“今军无现粮，当因敌为资。若虏见兵合，退依深山；追之则道险穷饿，兵还则出候寇抄。如此，兵不得解，所谓‘一日纵敌，患在数世’也。”遂前，军显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123},{"id":"shaodi-e-o013a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0cd1e6082bde64409582","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，吴将朱然等围襄阳之樊城，太傅司马宣王率众拒之。﹝一﹞六月，辛丑〖5〗，退。己卯〖6〗，以征东将军王凌为车骑将军〖7〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：正始二年（公元 241）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bf9ccbeb544f540e6afb","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33e60ac0c003858f0640","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"shaodi-q-o013","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0cd1e6082bde64409582","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，吴将朱然等围襄阳之樊城，太傅司马宣王率众拒之。﹝一﹞六月，辛丑〖5〗，退。己卯〖6〗，以征东将军王凌为车骑将军〖7〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"wendi-e-p080a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f526d1a1f2ac1dd03e36","layer":"pei","quote":"十一月辛未，镇西将军曹真命众将及州郡兵，讨破叛胡治元多、卢水封赏等。斩首五万余级，获生口十万，羊一百一十一万口，牛八万，河西遂平。","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dea0b21111fc3c1b95dd","start":10,"end":75},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o133b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8af6f7908a818f7cd9b1","layer":"original","quote":"琮与魏将王凌，战于芍陂；中郎将秦晃等十余人，战死。车骑将军朱然围樊，大将军诸葛瑾取柤中〖15〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":56,"end":104},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p009","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“霸字仲权。渊为蜀所害，故霸常切齿，欲有报蜀意。黄初中，为偏将军。子午之役，霸召为前锋；进至兴势围，安营在曲谷中。蜀人望知其是霸也，指下兵攻之。霸手战鹿角间，赖救至，然后解。后为右将军，屯陇西。其养士、和戎，并得其欢心。至正始中，代夏侯儒为征蜀护军，统属征西：时征西将军夏侯玄，于霸为从子；而玄于曹爽为外弟。及司马宣王诛曹爽，遂召玄，玄来东。霸闻曹爽被诛而玄又征，以为祸必转相及，心既内恐；又霸先与雍州刺史郭淮不和，而淮代玄为征西；霸尤不安，故遂奔蜀。南趋阴平而失道，入穷谷中。粮尽，杀马步行。足破，卧岩石上；使人求道，未知何之。蜀闻之，乃使人迎霸。初，建安五年，时霸从妹，年十三四，在本郡。出行樵采，为张飞所得。飞知其良家女，遂以为妻；产息女，为刘禅皇后。故渊之初亡，飞妻请而葬之。及霸入蜀，禅与相见，释之曰：‘卿父自遇害于行间耳，非我先人之手刃也。’指其儿子以示之曰：‘此夏侯氏之甥也。’厚加爵宠。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":0,"end":411},{"id":"zhulv-q-b67f8c2f45d747b56b24","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-d611d5b9e32237bf8be4","layer":"original","quote":"朱然攻樊，据与朱异破城外围；还，拜偏将军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":45,"end":65},{"id":"zhulv-q-c03cc9d0b63dbe4212b5","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-eaa5bf5e18e62b235391","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌四年，随朱然攻魏樊城；建计破其外围，还拜偏将军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
